      <p source="#source-567-737"><seg source="#source-567-699">私の志し実ニ十二ぶんもはこび申候間、則大兄ニも兼而御同意の事故、天下の大幸と御よろこび可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-699-711">レ</note><seg source="#source-711-714">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-714-726">レ</note><seg source="#source-726-737">遣候。</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-737-841"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-737-761"><rb>何</rb><rt>（いづれ）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-761-841">夕方までの内、御咄し仕候。又商会のものも御引合仕候。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-841-903" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p source="#source-862-903"><seg source="#source-862-868">四日</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-868-903" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-886-903">草々頓首。</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-903-920"><seg source="#source-903-920">九三老兄</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-920-983" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-941-983"><seg source="#source-941-950">御直披</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-950-983" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(1)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=1"><seg source="#source-980-983">龍</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
